    "reviewed_findings": [
      "Reviewed all 9 Thunderous variant pages and the 20 actual bindings; the canonical map contains exactly 9 variants and 20 bindings, with 9 corresponding reverse weapon pages. The current UI names, trait IDs, template imports/appends, restrictions, and shared icon URL/path agree with the frozen receipts and formal tables.",
      "All nine own tier records resolve to the bound ordinary on_hit wrapper, including the actual powermaul_p2 wrapper at line 106. I–IV request 1/2/3/4 target stacks; RAW English and Traditional Chinese share the verified description key/hash. The five plus-prefix families and four no-prefix families are reconstructed distinctly, preserving the literal English I-tier “1 stacks”.",
      "The player and comparison pages accurately constrain triggering to a held same-item hit on a Minion, processed after damage while the target remains HEALTH_ALIVE; there is no additional melee, special, or positive-damage predicate. Per-profile skip_on_hit_proc and global no-proc rules remain applicable.",
      "The route descriptions match the frozen actual-route evidence: ordinary/heavy/push-follow/special routes are distinguished; the crusher powered explosion and P3 arc retain the bound weapon item for their own Attack checks; the nine chainaxe sticky additional profiles skip on-hit. The powermaul_p2 entry is correctly described as the bound ordinary wrapper rather than an unbound special wrapper.",
      "The target debuff uses a shared named rending_debuff stack pool, +0.025 target rending input per effective stack, cap 16 and duration 5 seconds. A valid full-cap hit refreshes duration without exceeding cap; the parent 31-stack processing budget is not described as the target cap. The math limits its claims to target rending input and correctly avoids a fixed final-damage percentage.",
      "First-effect timing is accurately bounded: the triggering hit damage is already resolved before on-hit processing; later damage can read the debuff after target state/cache update, without promising same-frame subsequent hits. Switching items gates future procs while already applied target debuffs persist for their own duration.",
      "The approved image receipt separates the actual game icon path from its GitHub attachment URL and confirms public bytes/hash/display. Focused source, link, GFM, and shared-map checks in the fixed evidence are passing."
    ]
  },
